  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mvi 209.01 RSA 357-C:3, Prohibited Conduct. The scope of hearings held pursuant to RSA 357-C:3, shall be limited to whether any person has engaged in unfair business practice as specified in RSA 357-C:3, I through V.\n\nSource. #6980, eff 4-21-99, EXPIRED: 4-21-07\n\nNew. #8978, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRES: 3-12-08; ss by #9043-B eff 11-29-07; EXPIRED: 11-29-15\n\nNew. #11195, INTERIM, eff 10-15-16, EXPIRES: 4-3-17; ss by #12123, eff 3-2-17",
